      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just sounds so rhythmic and deliberate though. like it's not just random debris. is there any chance it's actually something more than just sediment? like could something actually be living or stuck in there that would make that kind of noise? i'm trying to figure out if i'm crazy for thinking it sounds \"active\"",
